     "content": [
      {
       "text": "RDF triples that are returned on a GET response to a repository resource should only contain \"subjects\" that are the resource itself.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Examples of where this is not currently being enforced include:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<resource>/fcr:metadata, and",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "<resource>/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
