     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=557058%3A24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" data-account-id=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" accountid=\"557058:24c578cc-15e9-4649-9f68-5eace85735e0\" rel=\"noreferrer\">A. Soroka</a>, given you recent work with:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1411\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1411</a></p>\n\n<p>Would you be interested in slicing off a piece of this ticket that ensures that GET requests on &lt;resource&gt;/fcr:metadata only return triples with the subject of &lt;resource&gt;?</p>",
